# URL of the PMTiles archive (or any MapLibre-compatible vector tile source URL).
#
# Default (used when this variable is unset): a PMTiles file served by this
# site itself from public/tiles/schleswig-holstein.pmtiles, i.e.
#   pmtiles://<site>/tiles/schleswig-holstein.pmtiles
# resolved against the page and the site's base path (see src/config.ts).
# Setting it also leaves that archive out of dist/ (vite-plugins/external-tiles.ts).
#
# Override to point at a CDN-hosted PMTiles archive instead, e.g.:
# VITE_TILES_URL=pmtiles://https://example-cdn.com/schleswig-holstein.pmtiles
VITE_TILES_URL=
